# Pasting one line while editing inserts it at the caret, dropping the @ of a tag-shaped word with a notice.
file <<END
Shopping:
	- Milk
END
see Milk
keys j <Enter> <Space>
paste <<END
and @cheese please
END
status Tags are set with commands
keys <Esc>
see - Milk and cheese please
quit
saved <<END
Shopping:
	- Milk and cheese please
END
